- The fifth involution $\sigma$, the conjugation by $\vec e_y$, written as $\sigma(X)=\varepsilon\bar X\varepsilon^{-1}$ with a possibly different $\varepsilon$, and the statement that it is not one of the four words of the algebra but a symmetry of the display.
